{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"dest","type":"text","text":"# 🧭 Destination — Charted vault\n\nDone when: **(1)** scope line drawn (Ring 1/2 in, Ring 3 out) · **(2)** portfolio + command-steering decided as a vault ADR · **(3)** keystone forks (NCF ownership, DB-first vs parse-first, stack) decided *enough to unblock the next path* · **(4)** DB-first rebuild taken as far as research allows (POC spec = best-effort, not a gate).\n\n_Nice-to-have: each near-term stream has a named next path. \"Open a future wayfinder\" is a valid resolution._","x":-420,"y":-680,"width":1060,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"map","type":"text","text":"## 🗺️ TASK-1 — Wayfinder map\n`wayfinder:map`\nPlan, don't do · monorepo lean · three rings","x":0,"y":-420,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t1_1","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.1 — Portfolio & command-steering ⭐\n`grilling` · **FRONTIER · first ticket**\nOne repo, many streams; how MP-skills scope to one. Lean: **monorepo + control plane + single backlog** → vault ADR.","x":-80,"y":-240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t1_2","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.2 — Build-own NCF vs SCF-derived\n`grilling` · **FRONTIER** · keystone\nParse source standards to own a de-licensed framework? Lean: yes.","x":-80,"y":-70,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t1_3","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.3 — Stack choice\n`grilling` · **FRONTIER**\nKeep proven Python OOXML core vs replatform app/AI layer. Bias: proven-stack for POC speed.","x":-80,"y":100,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t1_7","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.7 — Sequencing: DB-first vs parse-first\n`grilling` · blocked\nLean: DB-first (fast POC, keeps token model).","x":360,"y":-70,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t1_11","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.11 — Canonical source & CI build model\n`grilling` · blocked\nDe-licensed baselines; how CI rebuilds NCF. **The most expensive fork.**","x":740,"y":-80,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t1_8","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.8 — Rebuild vs port old code\n`grilling` · blocked\nLean: rescue data, rebuild thin layer.","x":360,"y":110,"width":300,"height":110,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t1_9","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.9 — Authoring / WYSIWYG UX\n`prototype` · blocked\nBiggest adoption risk. Consultants won't use markdown-in-a-textarea.","x":360,"y":280,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t1_10","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.10 — FAIR: Ring 2 or Ring 3?\n`grilling` · blocked\nScoping decision — FAIR *build* stays out until this resolves.","x":360,"y":460,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"fog","type":"text","text":"## 🌫️ Not yet specified (fog)\n\n_In scope, too fuzzy to ticket. Graduates as the frontier advances._\n\n- **Business model & tenancy** — consultant tool vs client product; single vs multi-tenant. *Owner has thinking done — ingestible near-term.*\n- **Funding shaping** — AU grants (CSIRO / R&D tax / Defence). *Needs the rest of the graph first.*\n- **Control plane** — in-repo harness to start/stop pulled-in apps. *Graduates off TASK-1.1.*\n- **Which sibling repos get pulled in** — *needs the monorepo layout first.*","x":-480,"y":640,"width":620,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"oos","type":"text","text":"## 🚫 Out of scope\n\n_Ring 3 — reference on tap, never scope. Returns only as a research ticket._\n\n- **OSCAL / policy-as-code / ontologies (UCO)**\n- **AI agents over control data** (future requirement)\n- **Cyber-insurance *market* productisation** (NCF-I *data profile* stays in)\n- **FAIR *implementation*** (until TASK-1.10 says otherwise)\n- **20+ suite bookshelf *build*** (DSP/CSOP are the live shelves)\n- **Open-source GRC tool evals** (pulled in per-fork as research)","x":200,"y":640,"width":640,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"t1_4","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.4 — RESEARCH: parse feasibility + source licensing\n`research` · ✅ findings ready\n**NIST 800-53 & CSF = public domain/CC0** (OSCAL JSON). ISO 27001 = copyrighted, don't parse text. First target: NIST 800-53 OSCAL.","x":-610,"y":-120,"width":440,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t1_5","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.5 — RESEARCH: SCF licensing terms\n`research` · ✅ findings ready\nSCF = **CC BY-ND 4.0**. Selling SCF-*derived* deliverables needs a paid commercial license + AI-gen ban. Clean-room rebuild escapes it.","x":-610,"y":100,"width":440,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t1_6","type":"text","text":"### TASK-1.6 — RESEARCH: FAIR scoping\n`research` · ✅ findings ready\nMinimal FAIR = free tools (Open FAIR Excel, FAIR-U), no custom code; gate is analyst skill. **Lean: Ring 2, tightly scoped.**","x":-610,"y":280,"width":440,"height":140,"color":"5"}
	],
